  "notes": "Film previs 'Blockout' tool. Near-black zinc UI with single amber (#f5a524) accent for active states (SHOOT mode, selected shot 1A, 24mm lens, Crane/Jib, primary Apply/Drop buttons); red (#e5484d) and blue (#3b82f6) mark character lanes (MAYA/DEX) and their dashed paths in 3D. Emoji used as icons in buttons (🎥, ✨, 🔁, ✋). Pill-shaped outline buttons clustered right-aligned over the viewport. Film-jargon presets (WS/FS/MS/MCU/CU, 2-SHOT, OTS, DUTCH), 39 camera-move presets, rig types. DELIVER mode exports shot packages and a generated prompt for AI video generators (Seedance). No codebook entry for a 3D scene/previs editor; proposed scene-editor-3d."
